    "Context: Core phenotypic screen to identify compounds active against both acute and chronic parasite stages. Method: We will screen the MMV Pathogen Box, containing 400 compounds with known antiparasitic activities, against both tachyzoites and bradyzoites. We will conduct the compound screening by treating both tachyzoite and bradyzoite cultures with 10 \u03bcM of each Pathogen Box compound for seven days, using DMSO as a negative control. Parasite viability will be monitored using fluorescence measurements of tdTomato-expressing parasites. For bradyzoites, we will assess compound efficacy by removing inhibitors after treatment and monitoring for tachyzoite regrowth over 28 days.": [
